AfterOS
=======

1.What is AfterOS
AfterOS is a open-source phone operating system
this operating system is based on Linux

2.Compile AfterOS
Compile AfterOS = Compile Linux kernel
you can is use Makefile to compile AfterOS

3.Downloads LiveFile
you can is use GitHub Releases or Website(https://deeplearning-corporation/afteros) to Download AfterOS LiveFile(ISO)

4.Legal
This project is use GPL v2 license(because based on Linux)

5.Thanks Read
Thanks Read this README docs
